===== README.md (Scaffold) =====
# example.com/todos

A typed Go client for the **Todos 1.2.3** RPC, generated by `leptoskit rpc generate --target go`.

It depends only on the standard library, and the calls go to the same routes the app itself uses. Rename the module path in `go.mod` to where you publish it.

## Usage

```go
client := todos.NewClient("https://todos.example")

result, err := client.ListTodos(ctx, /* ... */, /* ... */)
if err != nil {
	if fnErr := new(todos.FnError); errors.As(err, &fnErr) && fnErr.Retryable() {
		// a network or server failure: safe to try again
	}
	return err
}
```

`FnError.Kind` is one of `KindNetwork`, `KindInvalid`, `KindServer`, `KindDecode`, or `KindOther`, mirroring the server's classification; `Retryable` is true only for network failures. Shapes Go cannot model yet (tagged unions) appear as `any` holding the decoded JSON.
